## How to use this template

1. Copy to `~/.claude/agents/<project-name>-architect.md`
2. Replace `<project>` placeholder
3. Add stack-specific skills to `skills:` preload (limit 4)
4. Seed `MEMORY.md` with 1-2 starter ADRs documenting the current architecture
5. Test by asking: "Record that we're using <X> because <Y>"
6. Verify ADR appears in `.claude/agent-memory/<project>-architect/MEMORY.md`
